#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><title>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma5/plasma-all.xml:236
#, xml-text
msgid "About Commented out Packages"
msgstr "Acerca de Pacotes Comentados"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma5/plasma-all.xml:238
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The breeze-grub, breeze-plymouth, and plymouth-kcm packages above are all "
"for customized support of <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/Plymouth/\" "
">Plymouth</ulink> which is designed to be run within an initial ram disk "
"during boot (see <xref linkend=\"initramfs\"/>).  The plasma-sdk package is "
"optional and used for software development.  The plasma-nano package is used"
" for embedded systems.  The plasma-mobile package provides phone "
"functionality for Plasma.  The aura-browser package requires <xref "
"linkend=\"qtwebengine\"/>.  The discover package requires <xref "
"linkend=\"appstream\"/> to be built with the -Dqt=true switch. The "
"discover-5.27.10.1 version of the package is an update to the previous "
"version.  The plasma-welcome package requires the external package <ulink "
"url=\"https://download.kde.org/stable/release-service/&kf5apps-"
"version;/src/\"> kaccounts-integration</ulink>.  The flatpack-kcm package is"
" for managing support of flatpack applications."
msgstr ""
"Os pacotes breeze-grub, breeze-plymouth e plymouth-kcm acima são todos para "
"suporte personalizado do <ulink url=\"https://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/"
"Software/Plymouth/\" >Plymouth</ulink>, que é projetado para ser executado "
"em um disco RAM inicial durante a inicialização (veja-se <xref linkend="
"\"initramfs\"/>). O pacote plasma-sdk é opcional e usado para "
"desenvolvimento de software. O pacote plasma-nano é usado para sistemas "
"embarcados. O pacote plasma-mobile fornece funcionalidade de telefone para o "
"Plasma. O pacote aura-browser exige <xref linkend=\"qtwebengine\"/>. O "
"pacote discover exige <xref linkend=\"appstream\"/> para ser construído com "
"a chave -Dqt=true. A versão discover-5.27.10.1 do pacote é uma atualização "
"da versão anterior. O pacote plasma-welcome exige o pacote externo <ulink "
"url=\"https://download.kde.org/stable/release-service/&kf5apps-version;/src/"
"\">kaccounts-integration</ulink>. O pacote flatpack-kcm é para suporte de "
"gerenciamento de aplicativos flatpack."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma5/plasma-all.xml:268
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Plasma5"
msgstr "Instalação do Plasma5"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma5/plasma-all.xml:273
#, xml-text
msgid "First, start a subshell that will exit on error:"
msgstr "Primeiro, inicie um sub &quot;shell&quot; que sairá em caso de erro:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma5/plasma-all.xml:276
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>bash -e</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>bash -e</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma5/plasma-all.xml:279
#, xml-text
msgid "Install all of the packages by running the following commands:"
msgstr "Instale todos os pacotes executando os seguintes comandos:"

#.        # Fix some build issues when generating some configuration files
#.        case $name in
#.          plasma-workspace)
#.            sed -i '/set.HAVE_X11/a set(X11_FOUND 1)' CMakeLists.txt
#.          ;;
#.          khotkeys)
#.            sed -i '/X11Extras/a set(X11_FOUND 1)' CMakeLists.txt
#.          ;;
#.          plasma-desktop)
#.            sed -i '/X11.h)/i set(X11_FOUND 1)' CMakeLists.txt
#.          ;;
#.        esac
#.  some packages end up with files owned by root in $packagedir,
#.      so use as_root for removing
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma5/plasma-all.xml:283
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>while read -r line; do\n"
"\n"
"    # Get the file name, ignoring comments and blank lines\n"
"    if $(echo $line | grep -E -q '^ *$|^#' ); then continue; fi\n"
"    file=$(echo $line | cut -d\" \" -f2)\n"
"\n"
"    pkg=$(echo $file|sed 's|^.*/||')          # Remove directory\n"
"    packagedir=$(echo $pkg|sed 's|\\.tar.*||') # Package directory\n"
"\n"
"    tar -xf $file\n"
"    pushd $packagedir\n"
"\n"
"       mkdir build\n"
"       cd    build\n"
"\n"
"       cmake -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=$KF5_PREFIX \\\n"
"             -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release         \\\n"
"             -DBUILD_TESTING=OFF                \\\n"
"             -Wno-dev ..  &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"        make\n"
"        as_root make install\n"
"    popd\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"    as_root rm -rf $packagedir\n"
"    as_root /sbin/ldconfig\n"
"\n"
"done &lt; plasma-&plasma5-version;.md5\n"
"\n"
"exit</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>while read -r line; do\n"
"\n"
"    # Obtenha o nome do arquivo, ignorando comentários e linhas em branco\n"
"    if $(echo $line | grep -E -q '^ *$|^#' ); then continue; fi\n"
"    file=$(echo $line | cut -d\" \" -f2)\n"
"\n"
"    pkg=$(echo $file|sed 's|^.*/||')          # Remove diretório\n"
"    packagedir=$(echo $pkg|sed 's|\\.tar.*||') # Diretório do pacote\n"
"\n"
"    tar -xf $file\n"
"    pushd $packagedir\n"
"\n"
"       mkdir build\n"
"       cd    build\n"
"\n"
"       cmake -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=$KF5_PREFIX \\\n"
"             -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release         \\\n"
"             -DBUILD_TESTING=OFF                \\\n"
"             -Wno-dev ..  &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"        make\n"
"        as_root make install\n"
"    popd\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"    as_root rm -rf $packagedir\n"
"    as_root /sbin/ldconfig\n"
"\n"
"done &lt; plasma-&plasma5-version;.md5\n"
"\n"
"exit</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma5/plasma-all.xml:332
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you did not set <envar>$KF5_PREFIX</envar> to <filename>/usr</filename>, "
"create symlinks to allow display managers to find "
"<application>Plasma</application>, and to allow the XDG Desktop Portal to be"
" detected:"
msgstr ""
"Se você não configurou <envar>$KF5_PREFIX</envar> como <filename>/usr</"
"filename>, crie links simbólicos para permitir que gerenciadores de tela "
"encontrem o <application>Plasma</application> e para permitir que XDG "
"Desktop Portal seja detectado:"

#.  work around a bug in xdg-desktop-portal
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma5/plasma-all.xml:338
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>as_root install -dvm 755 /usr/share/xsessions              &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd /usr/share/xsessions/                                   &amp;&amp;\n"
"[ -e plasma.desktop ]                                      ||\n"
"as_root ln -sfv $KF5_PREFIX/share/xsessions/plasma.desktop &amp;&amp;\n"
"as_root install -dvm 755 /usr/share/wayland-sessions       &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd /usr/share/wayland-sessions/                            &amp;&amp;\n"
"[ -e plasmawayland.desktop ]                               ||\n"
"as_root ln -sfv $KF5_PREFIX/share/wayland-sessions/plasmawayland.desktop\n"
"as_root install -dvm 755 /usr/share/xdg-desktop-portal     &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd /usr/share/xdg-desktop-portal/                          &amp;&amp;\n"
"[ -e kde-portals.conf ]                                    ||\n"
"as_root ln -sfv $KF5_PREFIX/share/xdg-desktop-portal/kde-portals.conf\n"
"as_root install -dvm 755 /usr/share/xdg-desktop-portal/portals &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd /usr/share/xdg-desktop-portal/portals                       &amp;&amp;\n"
"[ -e kde.portal ]                                              ||\n"
"as_root ln -sfv $KF5_PREFIX/share/xdg-desktop-portal/portals/kde.portal\n"
"</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>as_root install -dvm 755 /usr/share/xsessions              "
"&amp;&amp;\n"
"cd /usr/share/xsessions/                                   &amp;&amp;\n"
"[ -e plasma.desktop ]                                      ||\n"
"as_root ln -sfv $KF5_PREFIX/share/xsessions/plasma.desktop &amp;&amp;\n"
"as_root install -dvm 755 /usr/share/wayland-sessions       &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd /usr/share/wayland-sessions/                            &amp;&amp;\n"
"[ -e plasmawayland.desktop ]                               ||\n"
"as_root ln -sfv $KF5_PREFIX/share/wayland-sessions/plasmawayland.desktop\n"
"as_root install -dvm 755 /usr/share/xdg-desktop-portal     &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd /usr/share/xdg-desktop-portal/                          &amp;&amp;\n"
"[ -e kde-portals.conf ]                                    ||\n"
"as_root ln -sfv $KF5_PREFIX/share/xdg-desktop-portal/kde-portals.conf\n"
"as_root install -dvm 755 /usr/share/xdg-desktop-portal/portals &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd /usr/share/xdg-desktop-portal/portals                       &amp;&amp;\n"
"[ -e kde.portal ]                                              ||\n"
"as_root ln -sfv $KF5_PREFIX/share/xdg-desktop-portal/portals/kde.portal\n"
"</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma5/plasma-all.xml:358
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Useless systemd units have been installed in <filename "
"class=\"directory\">$KF5_PREFIX/lib</filename>. Remove them now (as "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>):"
msgstr ""
"Unidades do &quot;systemd&quot; inúteis foram instaladas em &quot;<filename "
"class=\"directory\">$KF5_PREFIX/lib</filename>&quot;. Remova-as agora (como "
"&quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma5/plasma-all.xml:364
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>rm -rf $KF5_PREFIX/lib/systemd</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>rm -rf $KF5_PREFIX/lib/systemd</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma5/plasma-all.xml:379
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring Plasma"
msgstr "Configurando o Plasma"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma5/plasma-all.xml:382
#, xml-text
msgid "Linux PAM Configuration"
msgstr "Configuração do Linux PAM"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma5/plasma-all.xml:385
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you built Plasma with the recommended <application>Linux "
"PAM</application> support, create necessary configuration files by running "
"the following commands as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você construiu o &quot;Plasma&quot; com o suporte "
"&quot;<application>Linux PAM</application>&quot; recomendado, [então] crie "
"os necessários arquivos de configuração executando os seguintes comandos "
"como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma5/plasma-all.xml:391
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/pam.d/kde &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/pam.d/kde\n"
"\n"
"auth     requisite      pam_nologin.so\n"
"auth     required       pam_env.so\n"
"\n"
"auth     required       pam_succeed_if.so uid &gt;= 1000 quiet\n"
"auth     include        system-auth\n"
"\n"
"account  include        system-account\n"
"password include        system-password\n"
"session  include        system-session\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/pam.d/kde</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /etc/pam.d/kde-np &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/pam.d/kde-np\n"
"\n"
"auth     requisite      pam_nologin.so\n"
"auth     required       pam_env.so\n"
"\n"
"auth     required       pam_succeed_if.so uid &gt;= 1000 quiet\n"
"auth     required       pam_permit.so\n"
"\n"
"account  include        system-account\n"
"password include        system-password\n"
"session  include        system-session\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/pam.d/kde-np</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /etc/pam.d/kscreensaver &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/pam.d/kscreensaver\n"
"\n"
"auth    include system-auth\n"
"account include system-account\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/pam.d/kscreensaver</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/pam.d/kde &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Inicia /etc/pam.d/kde\n"
"\n"
"auth     requisite      pam_nologin.so\n"
"auth     required       pam_env.so\n"
"\n"
"auth     required       pam_succeed_if.so uid &gt;= 1000 quiet\n"
"auth     include        system-auth\n"
"\n"
"account  include        system-account\n"
"password include        system-password\n"
"session  include        system-session\n"
"\n"
"# Termina /etc/pam.d/kde</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /etc/pam.d/kde-np &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Inicia /etc/pam.d/kde-np\n"
"\n"
"auth     requisite      pam_nologin.so\n"
"auth     required       pam_env.so\n"
"\n"
"auth     required       pam_succeed_if.so uid &gt;= 1000 quiet\n"
"auth     required       pam_permit.so\n"
"\n"
"account  include        system-account\n"
"password include        system-password\n"
"session  include        system-session\n"
"\n"
"# Termina /etc/pam.d/kde-np</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /etc/pam.d/kscreensaver &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Inicia /etc/pam.d/kscreensaver\n"
"\n"
"auth    include system-auth\n"
"account include system-account\n"
"\n"
"# Termina /etc/pam.d/kscreensaver</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma5/plasma-all.xml:435
#, xml-text
msgid "Starting Plasma5"
msgstr "Iniciando o Plasma5"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma5/plasma-all.xml:438
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You can start <application>Plasma5</application> from runlevel 3, using "
"<xref linkend=\"xinit\"/>, or from runlevel 5, using a Display Manager, such"
" as <xref linkend=\"lightdm\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Você consegue iniciar o &quot;<application>Plasma5</application>&quot; a "
"partir do nível de execução 3, usando o &quot;<xref "
"linkend=\"xinit\"/>&quot;, ou a partir do nível de execução 5, usando um "
"Gerenciador de Tela, como o &quot;<xref linkend=\"lightdm\"/>&quot;."

#. , or from a graphical display manager, such as
#.       <xref linkend="sddm"/>
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma5/plasma-all.xml:444
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You can start <application>Plasma5</application> from a TTY, using <xref "
"linkend=\"xinit\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Você consegue iniciar o &quot;<application>Plasma5</application>&quot; a "
"partir de um &quot;TTY&quot;, usando o &quot;<xref "
"linkend=\"xinit\"/>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma5/plasma-all.xml:450
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To start <application>Plasma 5</application> using <xref "
"linkend=\"xinit\"/>, run the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Para iniciar o &quot;<application>Plasma 5</application>&quot; usando o "
"&quot;<xref linkend=\"xinit\"/>&quot;, execute os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma5/plasma-all.xml:454
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; ~/.xinitrc &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>dbus-launch --exit-with-x11 $KF5_PREFIX/bin/startplasma-x11</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"startx</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; ~/.xinitrc &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>dbus-launch --exit-with-x11 $KF5_PREFIX/bin/startplasma-x11</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"startx</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma5/plasma-all.xml:461
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The X session starts on the first unused virtual terminal, normally vt7.  "
"You can switch to another vt<emphasis>n</emphasis> simultaneously pressing "
"the keys Ctrl-Alt-F<emphasis>n</emphasis> (<emphasis>n</emphasis>=1, 2, "
"...).  To switch back to the X session, normally started at vt7, use Ctrl-"
"Alt-F7. The vt where the command <command>startx</command> was executed will"
" display many messages, including X starting messages, applications "
"automatically started with the session, and eventually, some warning and "
"error messages. You may prefer to redirect those messages to a log file, "
"which not only will keep the initial vt uncluttered, but can also be used "
"for debugging purposes. This can be done starting X with:"
msgstr ""
"A sessão do &quot;X&quot; inicia no primeiro terminal virtual não usado, "
"normalmente o &quot;vt7&quot;. Você consegue comutar para outro "
"&quot;vt<emphasis>n</emphasis>&quot; pressionando simultaneamente as teclas "
"&quot;Ctrl-Alt-F<emphasis>n</emphasis>&quot; (<emphasis>n</emphasis>=1, 2, "
"...). Para comutar de volta para a sessão do &quot;X&quot;, normalmente "
"iniciada no &quot;vt7&quot;, use &quot;Ctrl-Alt-F7&quot;. O &quot;vt&quot; "
"onde o comando &quot;<command>startx</command>&quot; foi executado exibirá "
"muitas mensagens, incluindo mensagens de iniciação do &quot;X&quot;, "
"aplicativos iniciados automaticamente com a sessão e, eventualmente, algumas"
" mensagens de aviso e erro. Você possivelmente prefira redirecionar essas "
"mensagens para um arquivo de registro, que não apenas manterá o "
"&quot;vt&quot; inicial organizado, mas também poderá ser usado para fins de "
"depuração. Isso pode ser feito iniciando-se o &quot;X&quot; com:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma5/plasma-all.xml:474
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>startx &amp;&gt; ~/x-session-errors</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>startx &amp;&gt; ~/x-session-errors</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma5/plasma-all.xml:477
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"When shutting down or rebooting, the shutdown messages appear on the vt "
"where X was running. If you wish to see those messages, simultaneously press"
" keys Alt-F7 (assuming that X was running on vt7)."
msgstr ""
"Ao desligar ou reinicializar, as mensagens de desligamento aparecem no "
"terminal virtual onde o X estava executando. Se você desejar ver essas "
"mensagens, pressione simultaneamente as teclas Alt-F7 (assumindo que o X "
"estava executando no terminal virtual 7)."

